f"><div class="upcSingleImageWrapper-bCVnT ihjIwj"><div class="UnifiedProductCardImageWrapper-jKuOXk jZFdLD"><a class="BaseLink-haTOKm UnifiedProductEmbedImageLink-jPiQIQ cOFTZe leLTwK image" href="https://cna." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener sponsored" tabindex="-1" data-offer-url="https://global.oliveyoung.com/product/detail?prdtNo=GA240825269&amp;"><span class="SpanWrapper-kFnjvc fvrhBe responsive-asset"><picture class="ResponsiveImagePicture-jKunQM gjCCFj responsive-image"><img loading="lazy" alt="Hera Black Cushion Foundation in branded component on a light gray background" class="ResponsiveImageContainer-dkeESL cQPiWi responsive-image__image" srcSet="https://media.allure.com/photos/67927cac69b05ea51da1f74a/3:4/w_120,c_limit/Hera%20Black%20Cushion%20Foundation.png 120w, https://media.allure.com/photos/67927cac69b05ea51da1f74a/3:4/w_240,c_limit/Hera%20Black%20Cushion%20Foundation.png 240w, https://media.allure.com/photos/67927cac69b05ea51da1f74a/3:4/w_320,c_limit/Hera%20Black%20Cushion%20Foundation.png 320w, https://media.allure.com/photos/67927cac69b05ea51da1f74a/3:4/w_640,c_limit/Hera%20Black%20Cushion%20Foundation.png 640w" sizes="100vw" src="https://media.allure.com/photos/67927cac69b05ea51da1f74a/3:4/w_748%2Cc_limit/Hera%2520Black%2520Cushion%2520Foundation.png"/></picture></span></a></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardImageTextContainer-loqUsV cjdDii"></div></div></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardBookmarkWrapper-lidVLr ijhFEn"><div><button class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva hOoaat button button--secondary upc-bookmark" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;}" data-testid="Button" aria-disabled="false" type="button"><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX eTFZtz button__label">Save to wishlist</span><div class="ButtonIconWrapper-iuocLJ hHKGkN button__icon-container"><svg class="icon-bookmark-outline icon icon-bookmark" width="24" height="24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Save to wishlist</title><path d="M11.6279 17.2126L5 21V4H19V21L12.3721 17.2126L12 17L11.6279 17.2126Z" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" class="icon-bookmark-stroke" fill="none"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-MMgYX dULYAp"><p class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardBrandName-jTSGxk cLWmIS hxumZM upc-brandName">Hera</p><div class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardNameWrapper-epSCgg bUFWkb imfchW"><h3 id="upc_67927c18f9b20781d8113d51" type="embed" class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardName-jkGINH evOpeu LMwdd">Black Cushion Foundation</h3></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardOfferWrapper-bjmgJL nJPes"><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$38OliveYoung"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_67927c18f9b20781d8113d51 button_label_$38OliveYoung" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Olive Young" data-offer-url="https://global.oliveyoung.com/product/detail?prdtNo=GA240825269&amp;" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6793eaeb4dda2881ac0768fd" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$38</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Olive Young</p></span></a></div></div><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$55Stylevana(2-Pack)"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_67927c18f9b20781d8113d51 button_label_$55Stylevana(2-Pack)" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Stylevana (2-Pack)" data-offer-url="https://www.stylevana.com/en_US/hera-black-cushion-spf34-pa-15g-x-2.html?" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6793eaeb4dda2881ac0768fe" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$55</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Stylevana (2-Pack)</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" data-journey-hook="client-content" data-testid="BodyWrapper"><div class="body__inner-container"><p>To even out her complexion, Chang uses the Black Cushion Foundation from the popular Korean makeup brand Hera. “I’ve been testing different cushions and have liked the glowy finish and easy application [from this one],” Chang tells <em>Allure</em>.</p><div class="Container-ioqmpI jzsvml"></div><p><a href="https://www.allure.com/story/lip-treatment-products" target="_blank" class="text link">Glossy lip products</a> had a big moment last year, and Chang was not immune to the hype—though instead of the popular glosses and tinted balms that went viral stateside, Chang fell in love with the Korean makeup brand Amuse’s Dew Tint. “I picked up different tints at <a data-offer-url="https://global.oliveyoung.com/?rwardCode=MISS888&amp;utm_source=influencers&amp;isRecommendationSectionFeatureOn=true" class="external-link text link" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://global.oliveyoung.com/?rwardCode=MISS888&amp;utm_source=influencers&amp;isRecommendationSectionFeatureOn=true&quot;}" href="https://global.oliveyoung.com/?rwardCode=MISS888&amp;utm_source=influencers&amp;isRecommendationSectionFeatureOn=true" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Olive Young</a> during a recent trip to Korea and it’s been fun to play and test,” says Chang.</p><h2><strong>Charlotte Cho, founder of SokoGlam and Then I Met You</strong></h2><p>Hydration, hydration, and hydration are three words that describe <a data-offer-url="https://www.instagram.com/charlottejcho/?hl=en" class="external-link text link" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.instagram.com/charlottejcho/?hl=en&quot;}" href="https://www.instagram.com/charlottejcho/?hl=en" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Charlotte Cho’s</a> skin-care routine. After double cleansing, the SokoGlam founder uses the Real Barrier Intense Moisture Toner, which has seven different types of hyaluronic acid wrapped up in one milky formula. She follows that up with the Torriden Dive Serum—with hyaluronic acid and allantoin—and her own Then I Met You Bong2 Bounce Cream. “It’s a citrusy moisturizer that not only smells like a dream but also does an incredible job of protecting your skin barrier,” says Cho.</p><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE cCvYrT grid grid-even grid-items-2 GroupCalloutWrapper-dilQaj fWWfCZ callout callout--group callout--group-2 product-group" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC dmHJJo grid--item"><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-fMbTZU jQTyKU product-embed" data-item="{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Real Barrier&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Extreme Essence Toner&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:null,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Real-Barrier-Hyaluronic-Moisturizer-Moisturizing/dp/B09GFDSXJM?th=1&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;6792918fc18d2a3e66739edc&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:null,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:false,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:2,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:3,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.allure.com/story/korean-beauty-founders-favorite-products&quot;,&quot;contentName&quot;:&quot;7 K-Beauty Founders Share Their Beauty MVPs&quot;},&quot;enableGtmFixesIntersectionObserver&quot;:true,&quot;enableGtmFixesUseRef&quot;:true,&quot;textBadge&quot;:null,&quot;seal&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6792918fc18d2a3e66739edc&quot;,&quot;brand&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Real Barrier&quot;},&quot;offers&quot;:[{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Real-Barrier-Hyaluronic-Moisturizer-Moisturizing/dp/B09GFDSXJM?th=1&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$18&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6793eb8801e9b926fe8b50c9&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://sokoglam.com/products/real-barrier-extreme-essence-toner-original&quot;,&