-Panthenol-Allantoin/dp/B07WZ2YTDP" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6798fa766025d2f5f241140a" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><del>$24</del> <span>$19</span> <span>(21% off)</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Amazon</p></span></a></div></div><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$24SokoGlam"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_67929344f8dff0b12706121f button_label_$24SokoGlam" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Soko Glam" data-offer-url="https://sokoglam.com/products/torriden-dive-in-low-molecular-hyaluronic-acid-serum" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6798fa766025d2f5f241140b" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$24</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Soko Glam</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" data-journey-hook="client-content" data-testid="BodyWrapper"><div class="body__inner-container"><p>Last but never least, Cho ends her morning skincare routine with her beloved IOPE Air Cushion SPF 50. “I&#x27;ve been using the IOPE Air Cushion for years—since IOPE invented cushion technology,” says Cho. “[Using it is] the only way my foundation looks airbrushed and not cakey.”</p><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE cCvYrT grid grid-even grid-items-2 GroupCalloutWrapper-dilQaj fWWfCZ callout callout--group callout--group-2 product-group" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC dmHJJo grid--item"><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-fMbTZU jQTyKU product-embed" data-item="{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Then I Met You&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Bong2 Bounce Cream&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:null,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Then-Met-You-lightweight-Cruelty-Free/dp/B0CZ3D78QX/&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;679293b9ed9d48375d8d4c48&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:null,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:false,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:2,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:5,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.allure.com/story/korean-beauty-founders-favorite-products&quot;,&quot;content