uct-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$42SokoGlam"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_6792945ef8dff0b127061221 button_label_$42SokoGlam" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Soko Glam" data-offer-url="https://sokoglam.com/products/iope-air-cushion-cover-21-vanilla-30g" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6793eca27d004758ba16e745" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$42</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Soko Glam</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h2><strong>Sarah Lee, Co-CEO of Glow Recipe</strong></h2><p>The other half of the Glow Recipe founding duo, <a data-offer-url="https://www.instagram.com/sarah_glow/?hl=en" class="external-link text link" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.instagram.com/sarah_glow/?hl=en&quot;}" href="https://www.instagram.com/sarah_glow/?hl=en" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Sarah Lee</a>, says her personal MVP among the brand’s lineup is Watermelon Glow PHA + BHA Pore-Tight Toner. Lee tells <em>Allure</em> that the toner was inspired by Korean aqua peel facials—a treatment that involves coating the skin in a water-based gel and using a suctioning device to exfoliate and remove dirt and debris (where do we sign up?).</p></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" dat