ttps://media.allure.com/photos/6797f1778046a82d1c67ddb2/3:4/w_240,c_limit/Dear%20Daliah%20Palette.png 240w, https://media.allure.com/photos/6797f1778046a82d1c67ddb2/3:4/w_320,c_limit/Dear%20Daliah%20Palette.png 320w, https://media.allure.com/photos/6797f1778046a82d1c67ddb2/3:4/w_640,c_limit/Dear%20Daliah%20Palette.png 640w" sizes="100vw" src="https://media.allure.com/photos/6797f1778046a82d1c67ddb2/3:4/w_748%2Cc_limit/Dear%2520Daliah%2520Palette.png"/></picture></span></a></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardImageTextContainer-loqUsV cjdDii"></div></div></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardBookmarkWrapper-lidVLr ijhFEn"><div><button class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva hOoaat button button--secondary upc-bookmark" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;}" data-testid="Button" aria-disabled="false" type="button"><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX eTFZtz button__label">Save to wishlist</span><div class="ButtonIconWrapper-iuocLJ hHKGkN button__icon-container"><svg class="icon-bookmark-outline icon icon-bookmark" width="24" height="24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Save to wishlist</title><path d="M11.6279 17.2126L5 21V4H19V21L12.3721 17.2126L12 17L11.6279 17.2126Z" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" class="icon-bookmark-stroke" fill="none"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-MMgYX dULYAp"><p class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardBrandName-jTSGxk cLWmIS hxumZM upc-brandName">Dear Dahlia</p><div class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardNameWrapper-epSCgg bUFWkb imfchW"><h3 id="upc_6797f0be80ec0b7459438ae5" type="embed" class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardName-jkGINH evOpeu LMwdd">Secret Garden Makeup Palette</h3></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardOfferWrapper-bjmgJL nJPes"><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$58Amazon"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_6797f0be80ec0b7459438ae5 button_label_$58Amazon" data-aps-asin="B0C3LQ7N3V" data-aps-asc-tag="allure0c3-20" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Amazon" data-offer-url="https://www.amazon.com/DEARDAHLIA-Secret-Garden-Palette-Party/dp/B0C3LQ7N3V/" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6797f19e6663741fa51ce98c" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$58</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Amazon</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>Makeup-wise, Paik reaches for rom&amp;nd Blur Fudge Tint and Dear Dahlia Timeless Bloom Collection Palette. “I use the lip tint almost every day for its natural finish,” says Paik. “I discovered Dear Dahlia while searching for vegan and cruelty-free cosmetic brands in Korea and fell in love with its eyeshadow palette. The shadows feel very gentle and smooth on the delicate eye area.”</p></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" data-journey-hook="client-content" data-testid="BodyWrapper"><div class="body__inner-container"><h2><strong>Ju Rhyu, co-founder of Hero Cosmetics</strong></h2><p><a data-offer-url="https://www.instagram.com/jurhyu/?hl=en" class="external-link text link" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.instagram.com/jurhyu/?hl=en&quot;}" href="https://www.instagram.com/jurhyu/?hl=en" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Ju Rhyu</a> wasted no time letting us know that Korean sunscreens are her favorite K-beauty product. “I love Beauty of Joseon and Roundlab Birch Moisturizer,” says Rhyu of her top SPFs. “They are so lightweight and water-based that they are a joy to apply—and [they’re] affordable. I use them after moisturizer and before makeup to protect my skin every day.”</p><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE cCvYrT grid grid-even grid-items-2 GroupCalloutWrapper-dilQaj fWWfCZ callout callout--group callout--group-2 product-group" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC dmHJJo grid--item"><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-fMbTZU jQTyKU product-embed" data-item="{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Round Lab&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:null,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/ROUND-LAB-Moisturizing-moisturizing-Friendly-Reef/dp/B0DJGWH3TC/&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;67928540f9b20781d8113d57&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:null,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:false,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:2,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:14,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[