="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardNameWrapper-epSCgg bUFWkb imfchW"><h3 id="upc_674b35f107facae78e272282" type="embed" class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardName-jkGINH evOpeu LMwdd">Daily Relief Sunscreen SPF 40</h3></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardOfferWrapper-bjmgJL nJPes"><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$18Amazon"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_674b35f107facae78e272282 button_label_$18Amazon" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Amazon" data-offer-url="https://beautyofjoseon.com/products/relief-sun-rice-probiotics" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6793e941e7bc5c6f23ecbade" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$18</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Amazon</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>Before excitedly slathering on SPF, Rhyu uses Superegg Vitality Elixir. “It&#x27;s a nice antioxidant serum by Erica Choi and Hoon Kim. I use it before my SPF to ensure added protection from free radicals,” says Rhyu.</p></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" data-journey-hook="client-content" data-testid="BodyWrapper"><div class="body__inner-container"><p>The Hero co-founder and CEO also has a “renewed appreciation” for luxury K-beauty brand Sulwhasoo. ”I really enjoy the Sulwhasoo Concentrated Ginseng Renewing Cream for when my skin needs more moisture on drier days,” says Rhyu.</p><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE hLNWRb grid grid-even grid-items-3 GroupCalloutWrapper-dilQaj fWWfCZ callout callout--group callout--group-3 product-group" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC dmHJJo grid--item"><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-fMbTZU jQTyKU product-embed" data-item="{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Superegg&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Vitamin Collective Vitality Elixir&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:null,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/SUPEREGG-Vitamin-Collective-Elixir-B%C2%B7C%C2%B7/dp/B0BTY1XFWF&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;679286db980632c08fcc0d46&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:null,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:false,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:2,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:16,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.allure.com/story/korean-beauty-founders-favorite-products&quot;,&quot;contentName&quot;:&quot;7 K-Beauty Founders Share The