ductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$13Dermstore"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_67928bb3f8dff0b127061216 button_label_$13Dermstore" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Dermstore" data-offer-url="https://www.dermstore.com/p/hero-cosmetics-mighty-patch-original/12191952/?" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6793ef92574a8c995ef31bcb" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$13</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Dermstore</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" data-journey-hook="client-content" data-testid="BodyWrapper"><div class="body__inner-container"><p>Rhyu also reaches for her own Hero Cosmetics Mighty Patch Original when she needs to fight off a blemish—just like we do. We gave the patches a <a href="https://www.allure.com/story/best-of-beauty-skin-care-product-winners-2024#Best-Acne-Treatments" class="text link">2024 Best of Beauty award</a>.</p><h2><strong>Liah Yoo, founder of KraveBeauty</strong></h2><p>You’ve likely come across at least one of KraveBeauty’s viral products on TikTok—perhaps the <a href="https://www.allure.com/story/best-of-beauty-skin-care-product-winners-2024#Best-Face-Sunscreens" class="text link">Best of Beauty-winning</a> Beet The Sun SPF 40. If you love it as much as we do, you have <a data-offer-url="https://www.instagram.com/liahyoo/?hl=en" class="external-link text link" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.instagram.com/liahyoo/?hl=en&quot;}" href="https://www.instagram.com/liahyoo/?hl=en" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Liah Yoo</a> to thank.</p><p>Yoo starts her own routine by cleansing with Experiment Beauty Plasma Wash. “I usually have low expectations for cleansers, but this one completely blew me away,” says Yoo. “After using it, my skin feels like it’s been treated to a hydrating mask.”</p><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE cCvYrT grid grid-even grid-items-2 GroupCalloutWrapper-dilQaj fWWfCZ callout callout--group callout--group-2 product-group" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC dmHJJo grid--item"><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-fMbTZU jQTyKU product-embed" data-item="{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;KraveBeauty&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Beet The Sun SPF 40 PA+++ Broad Spectrum Sunscreen&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:null,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/KraveBeauty-Spectrum-Non-Greasy-Lightweight-Sunscreen/dp/B0BZDRT1BZ?&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;6792954b768105aaf93020b1&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:null,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:false,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineL