ss="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX eTFZtz button__label">Save to wishlist</span><div class="ButtonIconWrapper-iuocLJ hHKGkN button__icon-container"><svg class="icon-bookmark-outline icon icon-bookmark" width="24" height="24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Save to wishlist</title><path d="M11.6279 17.2126L5 21V4H19V21L12.3721 17.2126L12 17L11.6279 17.2126Z" stroke="black" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" class="icon-bookmark-stroke" fill="none"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-MMgYX dULYAp"><p class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardBrandName-jTSGxk cLWmIS hxumZM upc-brandName">KraveBeauty</p><div class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardNameWrapper-epSCgg bUFWkb imfchW"><h3 id="upc_6792970e980632c08fcc0d49" type="embed" class="BaseText-fEwdHD UnifiedProductCardName-jkGINH evOpeu LMwdd">Oil La La Linoleic Acid-Rich Oil Serum</h3></div><div class="UnifiedProductCardOfferWrapper-bjmgJL nJPes"><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$29Amazon"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_6792970e980632c08fcc0d49 button_label_$29Amazon" data-aps-asin="B0CLDTX1J5" data-aps-asc-tag="allure0c3-20" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="Amazon" data-offer-url="https://www.amazon.com/KraveBeauty-Linoleic-Acid-Rich-Breakouts-Cruelty-Free/dp/B0CLDTX1J5?" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6792978be53b3050bb3542fc" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$29</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">Amazon</p></span></a></div></div><div class="ProductOfferWrapper-jbhYWP iiBYgp product-offer" data-testid="product-offer-wrapper"><div class="ProductOfferCtaBlock-cuZdYn bMpPDL product-offer__cta-block" id="button_label_$28KraveBeauty"><a href="https://cna." rel="sponsored noopener" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="upc_6792970e980632c08fcc0d49 button_label_$28KraveBeauty" data-buy-button="true" data-offer-retailer="KraveBeauty" data-offer-url="https://kravebeauty.com/products/oil-la-la?" class="BaseButton-bcGmUs ButtonWrapper-dPMEWm dXLnva rhJKg button button--primary-pair product-offer__buy-button" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;Button&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;}" data-testid="Button" id="6792978be53b3050bb3542fd" type=""><span class="ButtonLabel-eCjeQX gMxkqd button__label"><span>$28</span> <p class="price-above-seller-name">KraveBeauty</p></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>She also uses her own KraveBeauty Oil La La serum religiously, calling it “gentle yet effective” and pointing to its blend of linoleic acid-rich oils including rosehip seed, jojoba, sunflower, and grapeseed.</p><h2><strong>Alicia Yoon, founder and CEO of Peach &amp; Lily</strong></h2><p>The <a href="https://www.allure.com/story/what-is-double-cleansing" target="_blank" class="text link">double cleansing</a> method—as in, washing your face with an oil-based cleanser followed by a water-based one—was popularized by K-beauty brands, so it’s no surprise that Peach &amp; Lily founder <a data-offer-url="https://www.instagram.com/aliciayoon212/?hl=en" class="external-link text link" data-event-click="{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://www.instagram.com/aliciayoon212/?hl=en&quot;}" href="https://www.instagram.com/aliciayoon212/?hl=en" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Alicia Yoon</a> starts her skin-care routine off her routine with this technique, first using her brand’s Ginger Melt Oil Cleanser. “I love that this effortlessly dissolves all makeup and stubborn SPF without any residue or breaking me out or making my eyes foggy,” says Yoon. (<em>Allure</em> editors can also vouch for Ginger Melt’s mighty cleansing power—we deemed it a <a href="https://www.allure.com/story/best-of-beauty-skin-care-product-winners-2024#Best-Facial-Cleansers" target="_blank" class="text link">2024 Best of Beauty winner</a>.)</p></div></div></div><div class="GridItem-bufwYC fdedvq grid--item grid-layout__aside"></div></div><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE dCnZHU grid grid-margins grid-items-2 ArticlePageChunksGrid-kSknMg dSvDdx grid-layout--adrail narrow wide-adrail" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC kKTABR grid--item grid-layout__content"><div class="BodyWrapper-cuqCAc bjOcqR body body__container article__body" data-journey-hook="client-content" data-testid="BodyWrapper"><div class="body__inner-container"><div class="GridWrapper-uulHE cCvYrT grid grid-even grid-items-2 GroupCalloutWrapper-dilQaj fWWfCZ callout callout--group callout--group-2 product-group" data-journey-hook="grid-wrapper"><div class="GridItem-bufwYC dmHJJo grid--item"><div class="UnifiedProductCardBody-fMbTZU jQTyKU product-embed" data-item="{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Peach &amp;amp; Lily&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Ginger Melt Oil Cleanser&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:null,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Ulta Beauty&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.ulta.com/p/ginger-melt-oil-cleanser-pimprod2030963?&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;67927f2442eb1b0d5ea99605&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:null,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:false,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;