We earn a commission for products purchased on this page."},"userPlatform":{"isDomainSigninSwitchEnabled":false,"siteCode":"ALLURE","userPlatformProxy":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.allure.com\u002Fapi\u002Fup","xClientID":"Verso-Allure","filterBookmarkTypes":["Article","Gallery"],"federatedGraphqlUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fgraphql.condenast.io\u002Fgraphql"},"experiments":{"assignments":[]},"martechPlatform":{},"sophiConfig":{"enabled":false,"hostId":""},"beOp":{},"inlineRecirc":[],"linkList":null,"related":[],"seriesData":null,"showFirstRailRecirc":false,"productCarousel":{},"presenterResponseHeaders":{"surrogate-key":""},"metadataVideo":{},"hidePrimaryNavigationBar":false,"communityExperience":{"disableCommentStream":true,"enableCommunityExperience":false,"enableLocationDropdown":false,"hasHideCommunityFunctionalTag":false,"hasShowCommunityFunctionalTag":false,"expandCommentsOnLoadFunctionalTag":false,"enableArtistQA":false,"enableRepliesRestriction":false},"commentAttributes":{"organizationId":"4gKgcEzcAZvqb9t5pcZHNaDvXACy","commentingUrl":"","tenantID":"","reviewNotesFormSignInURL":"\u002Fauth\u002Finitiate?redirectURL=%2Fstory%2Fkorean-beauty-founders-favorite-products%3Fsource%3DCOMMUNITY_LOGIN%23leave-a-rating&source=COMMUNITY_LOGIN","isBookmarkingEnabled":true},"communityLogo":null,"closrRecirc":{"closrRecircData":[]},"visualStoryBanner":null,"featuredDeal":null,"puzzlesAndGames":null,"layoutConfigs":{},"article":{"id":"67915d9475d8c2a6a29b44d4","body":["div",["p","If Korea stands as the capital of the skin-care kingdom, then the founders of K-beauty brands are its faithful guards. These business-savvy, well-moisturized individuals (including ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Faliciayoon212\u002F?hl=en","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Faliciayoon212\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Alicia Yoon"]," of Peach & Lily, ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fliahyoo\u002F?hl=en","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fliahyoo\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Liah Yoo"]," of KraveBeauty, and ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fcharlottejcho\u002F?hl=en","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fcharlottejcho\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Charlotte Cho"]," of Then I Met You) are experts among experts. So in an eager desire to be further in the know about the hi-tech treatments, souped-up formulas, and innovative ingredients coming out of Korea, we asked them to share the K-beauty products on regular rotation in their own routines. Of course, they have favorites within their own brands, but we also asked them what other K-beauty products they swear by—like, is there a secret, under-the-radar serum that gives them enviable glass skin?"],["cm-unit"],["p","Despite the heralded 10-step Korean skin-care routine, most of these founders keep their beauty routines fairly simple, focusing on hydration and barrier maintenance—with a few special additions that eliminate texture, purify the skin, and of course, induce a healthy glow. And since the focus of their regimens is on skin care, many tend to keep their makeup minimal—using products that subtly enhance their natural features, like glossy lip tints and lightweight cushion foundations."],["journey-inline-newsletter",{"newsletterType":"slim-newsletter","newsletters":[]}],["inline-newsletter",{"newsletterType":"slim-newsletter","newsletters":[]}],["p","Keep reading for the products your (and our) favorite K-beauty founders use on the daily."],["native-ad",{"position":"in-content","shouldDisplayLabel":true}],["h2",["strong","Christine Chang, Co-CEO of Glow Recipe"]],["p","A big component of ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fchristine_glow\u002F?hl=en","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fchristine_glow\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Christine Chang"],"’s beauty routine is prepping her skin for makeup—though on most occasions you may not even be able to tell that Chang is wearing any. She prepares her skin for seamless application using her own Glow Recipe Watermelon Glow Niacinamide Dew Drops. “This serum is my daily niacinamide treatment but it creates such a beautiful, emollient base for any makeup and makes the morning routine so easy,” says Chang."],["native-ad",{"position":"sponsor-product","shouldDisplayLabel":true}],["inline-embed",{"props":{"name":"group-3","attrs":{},"childTypes":["product","product","product"],"hasProductChildren":true,"isUpcEnabled":true},"ref":"","type":"callout:group-3"},["inline-embed",{"props":{"ctaHref":"https:\u002F\u002Fcna.st\u002Fp\","dangerousDek":"","productBrand":"Glow Recipe","dangerousHed":"Watermelon Glow Niacinamide Dew Drops","embedSize":null,"isFirstProduct":true,"image":{"altText":"Glow Recipe Watermelon Glow Niacinamide Dew Drops bottle component on light gray background","credit":null,"sources":{"sm":{"aspectRatio":"3:4","width":320,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F66b0d97881e889c3af660f80\u002F3:4\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FGlow%20Recipe%20Watermelon%20Glow%20Niacinamide%20Dew%20Drops.png","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F66b0d97881e889c3af660f80\u002F3:4\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FGlow%20Recipe%20Watermelon%20Glow%20Niacinamide%20Dew%20Drops.png 120w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F66b0d97881e889c3af660f80\u002F3:4\u002Fw_240,c_limit\u002FGlow%20Recipe%20Watermelon%20Glow%20Niacinamide%20Dew%20Drops.png 240w, https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F66b0d97881e889c3af660f80\u002F3:4\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FGlow%20Recipe%20Watermelon%20Glow%20Niaci