":true,"showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct":false,"enableAffiliateDisclaimerLabel":false,"dangerousCredit":null,"showLocalisedOffers":false,"hasCheckPriceFeature":false,"isUpcEnabled":true,"showClampedProductDescription":true,"productDescriptionLineLength":2,"hasReadMoreFeature":false,"index":2,"hasAffiliateLinkDisabled":false,"isMobileView":false,"showMultipleImageCount":4,"hasProsConsFeature":false,"hasRatingFeature":false,"pros":[],"cons":[],"rating":"","shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData":true,"contentInfo":{"contentUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.allure.com\u002Fstory\u002Fkorean-beauty-founders-favorite-products","contentName":"7 K-Beauty Founders Share Their Beauty MVPs"},"cardRouting":{"renderAs":"upc-product","sourceType":"product","resolvedContentType":"product"},"enableGtmFixesIntersectionObserver":true,"enableGtmFixesUseRef":true,"textBadge":null,"seal":null},"level":"block","ref":"67927c18f9b20781d8113d51","type":"product"}]],["ad",{"position":"mid-content"}],["p","To even out her complexion, Chang uses the Black Cushion Foundation from the popular Korean makeup brand Hera. “I’ve been testing different cushions and have liked the glowy finish and easy application [from this one],” Chang tells ",["em","Allure"],"."],["inline-embed",{"type":"cneinterlude","props":{"brand":"allure","embeddedVideos":["67893a090f90d572926bfaa9"],"hasExcludedEmbed":false,"playerBase":"https:\u002F\u002Fplayer.cnevids.com","isRailEligible":false,"isRightRail":false,"relatedVideo":{"showRelatedVideo":false,"brand":"allure","related":null,"pageSize":12}}}],["p",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.allure.com\u002Fstory\u002Flip-treatment-products","target":"_blank","class":"text link","isExternal":false},"Glossy lip products"]," had a big moment last year, and Chang was not immune to the hype—though instead of the popular glosses and tinted balms that went viral stateside, Chang fell in love with the Korean makeup brand Amuse’s Dew Tint. “I picked up different tints at ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fglobal.oliveyoung.com\u002F?rwardCode=MISS888&utm_source=influencers&isRecommendationSectionFeatureOn=true","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fglobal.oliveyoung.com\u002F?rwardCode=MISS888&utm_source=influencers&isRecommendationSectionFeatureOn=true"},"isExternal":true},"Olive Young"]," during a recent trip to Korea and it’s been fun to play and test,” says Chang."],["h2",["strong","Charlotte Cho, founder of SokoGlam and Then I Met You"]],["p","Hydration, hydration, and hydration are three words that describe ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fcharlottejcho\u002F?hl=en","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fcharlottejcho\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Charlotte Cho’s"]," skin-care routine. After double cleansing, the SokoGlam founder uses the Real Barrier Intense Moisture Toner, which has seven different types of hyaluronic acid wrapped up in one milky formula. She follows that up with the Torriden Dive Serum—with hyaluronic acid and allantoin—and her own Then I Met You Bong2 Bounce Cream. “It’s a citrusy moisturizer that not only smells like a dream but also does an incredible job of protecting your skin barrier,” says Cho."],["inline-embed",{"props":{"name":"group-2","attrs":{},"childTypes":["product","product"],"hasProductChildren":true,"isUpcEnabled":true},"ref":"","type":"callout:group-2"},["inline-embed",{"props":{"ctaHref":"https:\u002F\u002Fcna.st\u002Fp\","dangerousDek":"","productBrand":"Real Barrier","dangerousHed":"Extreme Essence Toner","embedSize":null,"isFirstProduct":false,"image":{"altText":"Real Barrier Extreme Essence Toner white bottle with blue cap on light gray background","credit":null,"sources":{"sm":{"aspectRatio":"3:4","width":320,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F6793eb4fe7bc5c6f23ecbae0\u002F