0ec0b7459438ae5","type":"product"}]],["p","Makeup-wise, Paik reaches for rom&nd Blur Fudge Tint and Dear Dahlia Timeless Bloom Collection Palette. “I use the lip tint almost every day for its natural finish,” says Paik. “I discovered Dear Dahlia while searching for vegan and cruelty-free cosmetic brands in Korea and fell in love with its eyeshadow palette. The shadows feel very gentle and smooth on the delicate eye area.”"],["ad",{"position":"mid-content"}],["h2",["strong","Ju Rhyu, co-founder of Hero Cosmetics"]],["p",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fjurhyu\u002F?hl=en","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fjurhyu\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Ju Rhyu"]," wasted no time letting us know that Korean sunscreens are her favorite K-beauty product. “I love Beauty of Joseon and Roundlab Birch Moisturizer,” says Rhyu of her top SPFs. “They are so lightweight and water-based that they are a joy to apply—and [they’re] affordable. I use them after moisturizer and before makeup to protect my skin every day.”"],["inline-embed",{"props":{"name":"group-2","attrs":{},"childTypes":["product","product"],"hasProductChildren":true,"isUpcEnabled":true},"ref":"","type":"callout:group-2"},["inline-embed",{"props":{"ctaHref":"https:\u002F\u002Fcna.st\u002Fp\","dangerousDek":"","productBrand":"Round Lab","dangerousHed":"Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen","embedSize":null,"isFirstProduct":false,"image":{"altText":"Round Lab Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen in branded tube component on a light gray background","credit":null,"sources":{"sm":{"aspectRatio":"3:4","width":320,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F67928645bf9ac3f6ce5cf8aa\u002F3:4\u002Fw_320,c_limit\u002FRound%20Lab%20Birch%20Moisturizing%20Sunscreen.png","srcset":"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.allure.com\u002Fphotos\u002F67928645bf9ac3f6ce5cf8aa\u002F3:4\u002Fw_120,c_limit\u002FRound%20Lab%20Birch%20Moisturizing%20Sun