um religiously, calling it “gentle yet effective” and pointing to its blend of linoleic acid-rich oils including rosehip seed, jojoba, sunflower, and grapeseed."],["h2",["strong","Alicia Yoon, founder and CEO of Peach & Lily"]],["p","The ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.allure.com\u002Fstory\u002Fwhat-is-double-cleansing","target":"_blank","class":"text link","isExternal":false},"double cleansing"]," method—as in, washing your face with an oil-based cleanser followed by a water-based one—was popularized by K-beauty brands, so it’s no surprise that Peach & Lily founder ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Faliciayoon212\u002F?hl=en","target":"_blank","class":"text link","rel":"nofollow noopener","attributes":{"data-offer-url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Faliciayoon212\u002F?hl=en"},"isExternal":true},"Alicia Yoon"]," starts her skin-care routine off her routine with this technique, first using her brand’s Ginger Melt Oil Cleanser. “I love that this effortlessly dissolves all makeup and stubborn SPF without any residue or breaking me out or making my eyes foggy,” says Yoon. (",["em","Allure"]," editors can also vouch for Ginger Melt’s mighty cleansing power—we deemed it a ",["a",{"href":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.allure.com\u002Fstory\u002Fbest-of-beauty-skin-care-product-winners-2024#Best-Facial-Cleansers","target":"_blank","class":"text link","isExternal":false},"2024 Best of Beauty winner"],".)"],["ad",{"position":"mid-content"}],["inline-embed",{"props":{"name":"group-2","attrs":{},"childTypes":["product","product"],"hasProductChildren":true,"isUpcEnabled":true},"ref":"","type":"callout:group-2"},["inline-embed",{"props":{"ctaHref":"https:\u002F\u002Fcna.st\u002Fp\","dangerousDek":"","productBrand":"Peach &amp; Lily","dangerousHed":"Ginger Melt Oil Cleanser","embedSize":null,"isFirstProduct":false,"image":{"altText":"Peach & Lily Ginger Melt Oil Cleanser in branded component with best of beauty seal in the top right corner on a lig